OL,3,ATeen shot friend by mistake, inquest
OL,4,Atold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager told an inquest he fatally
OL,7,Fshot his friend with an air rifle at a
OL,8,Fhouse party after mistaking the trigger
OL,9,Ffor the safety catch.
OL,11,FConnor Bell, 17, from Tadley, had been
OL,12,Fdrinking with friends at a house in
OL,13,FChineham, near Basingstoke, on 8
OL,14,FNovember 2025 when he was hit by a
OL,15,Fpellet fired by Jack Beechy, the
OL,16,FWinchester inquest heard.
OL,18,FThe pellet entered through his right
OL,19,Feye socket, causing an "unsurvivable"
OL,20,Fbrain injury and cardiac arrest. He
OL,21,Fdied at Southampton General Hospital
OL,22,Ftwo days later.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
